    {
      "id": 21185,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-11T13:25:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I went with Citizen Dawn. Reason being, her Citizen’s are awesome with them being named after seasons, games, and other things. Not to mention each of the citizens have an ability that strengthens the other ones that share the inspired names, asside for the seasons and Hammer, but Hammer gets revived when Anvil is out, so it is half and half. Oh and Truth and Dare actually kill the other one doing a good amount of damage, which isn’t too bad of a trait especially when Truth is out at the same time a Anvil. So when Dare comes out it is more of a blessing than a curse. Not too mention she is probably the toughest villian out there and gets even tougher if you don’t have Visionary in the party.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:55:17.439Z",
