      "id": 21190,
      "name": "Adam",
      "username": "Adam",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/adam/{size}/1946_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-11T15:06:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Baron Blade is my favorite in flavor, I just have a love for the character, as well as Voss, but I think the way Omnitron plays is fantastic. What I think I love about it is that it callously deploys the same amount of things every turn. It seems methodical and really has the feeling of being a machine.</p>",
