      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-11T18:10:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Citizen Dawn and Voss are the biggest challenges to play, and I really enjoy facing them (especially on advanced mode!)  However, I love the flip mechanics for Baron Blade and Omnitron.  I’m excited about the flip mechanics and other villain tricks for the next expansion <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>",
