      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/85e7bf/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-11T20:56:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My favorite villain is Baron Blade. I love the flavor of him so much. The fact that he has a mobile defense platform is sweet and flavorful. His flip mechanic in my own opinion is the most flavorful of all of them because you can really see and mad scientist getting beat then running away into his big mech to try and destroy the heroes.</p>",
