about. The fact he is also able to destroy equipment cards makes a few heroes weaken, and he even destroy ongoing cards while dealing five damage to all. Then there is the card that allows him to be immune to the last type a damage that had hit him, which can be really annoying depending on who is in the battle and the turn order. It's even worse when you have Ra and had played Imbue Fire, but at least he can use his power turn to destroy it, just hopefully he isn't the last in turn.",
